WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.320
For a direct jump, open the command palette with Command K on a Mac or Control K on Windows.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.820
Type the ticket number into the search field.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.170
Check the title and number on the result before selecting it.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:16.210
The palette opens the ticket workspace, not just a filtered list.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:19.660
Verify the number in the workspace header before making an update.
